<p local-id=3D"60afd0d4f9da">semantics: Carrier KL brings a bag to Chicago-=
airport and advises that -to KL-knowledge- this bag transfers to a United f=
light. License plate and passenger name are shared</p>
<p local-id=3D"e27a6a56bbaa">analysis:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"2884a1414d1a">
<li local-id=3D"6795da00c2c9">
<p local-id=3D"d59dd6af4986">BTM purpose is to advise transferring <u>bags =
</u>at destination of this flight to <u>other member</u>. I.e. typically ai=
rline to airline notification. Hence BTM maps to BagNotifRQ</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"3a022b40a35e">
<p local-id=3D"43996d44bb77">BTM .I is mandatory, <span class=3D"inline-com=
ment-marker" data-ref=3D"1c563fa0-5883-4597-8694-552c6207221d">.F is option=
al</span>. The message is populated from perspective of the inbound flight.=
 .I is the active segment and hence maps to Carrying Segment. .F maps to On=
ward Bag Segment (.O would map to Onward Bag Segment as well)</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"f1a2faf41476">
<p local-id=3D"5c3618d48dbe">.N license plate maps to the BagTag element</p=
>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"f8fd65db43f6">
<p local-id=3D"a1717a2953c2">.P maps to the Owner element</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"c6510ffaf855">
<p local-id=3D"cb7f7ba64270">.V maps to Baggage Process element. Note Bagga=
ge Source=3DT is mapped to Baggage Process Code=3DF (arriving for transfer)=
 to reflect .I (arriving flight) is the active transportation in this messa=
ge</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"0461089bdb67">result: <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"htt=
ps://iataonline.sharepoint.com/:u:/r/sites/IATABaggageWorkingGroup/Shared%2=
0Documents/Baggage%20Information%20Exchange%20(BIX)%20Sub%20Group/Taskforce=
%20best%20practices%20BIX%20v2/Samples/source%20RP1745/3.9.1%20BTM%20with%2=
0minimum%20elements.xml?csf=3D1&amp;web=3D1&amp;e=3DTBbIa2" rel=3D"nofollow=
">3.9.1 BTM with minimum elements</a></p>
<ul local-id=3D"c7192ddefab7">
<li local-id=3D"ac1e3232951e">
<p local-id=3D"798b494f1e26">Note the sample message rendered in xml includ=
es the same message rendered in tty, and name of sample is taken from sourc=
e RP</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"c4a57eb98119"></p>
<h3 local-id=3D"45f17f7f23b1" id=3D"id-3.9BTMexamples-secondpasscompleted-3=
